B.c9g=new A.he("Relationship & Lifestyle Advisor","MARIAM DUSABE represents NGMY Advisors with grace and confidence. She offers thoughtful companionship, dating conversation, and everyday life support \u2014 poised, selective, and fully present for meaningful talk.","Elegant and approachable. Warm when trust is earned; composed standards from the first hello.")
B.c9_=new A.he("Personal Connection Advisor","SUZANA VANESSA is a rising voice on NGMY Advisors \u2014 charming, grounded, and open to real conversation. Members may talk through dating, daily life, hopes, or simply good company. She welcomes dialogue with professionalism and self-respect.","Refined connection: playful yet dignified, hard to rush, easy to talk to about anything.")
B.c99=new A.he("Lifestyle & Guidance Advisor","ANNA AMURI brings polished counsel to NGMY Advisors members seeking balance, clarity, and confident next steps in personal and social life.","Calm, articulate, and encouraging \u2014 practical wisdom with modern elegance.")
