B.c94=new A.he("Personal Growth Advisor","SUZANA MBUTO supports members navigating growth, relationships, and daily decisions with steady judgment and a welcoming presence on NGMY Advisors.","Steady, warm, and clear \u2014 mentorship with sisterly care and professional poise.")
B.c9b=new A.he("Social & Lifestyle Advisor","SUZY BENET is a verified NGMY Advisors advisor known for stylish conversation, social confidence, and honest perspective.","Chic, witty, and professional \u2014 good company with high standards.")
B.c9k=new A.he("Wellness & Presence Advisor","MINA SAMUEL guides members toward calmer days, healthier habits of mind, and conversations that restore focus and peace.","Gentle professionalism \u2014 soft tone, clear boundaries, lasting encouragement.")
B.c8U=new A.he("Strategic Life Advisor","ALEX REMY provides sharp, respectful guidance for careers, decisions, and daily strategy as a certified NGMY Advisors professional.","Direct, respectful, and composed \u2014 premium advice without the clutter.")
B.c90=new A.he("Ethics & Counsel Advisor","JEREMIAH NESTO offers principled counsel for members seeking direction, integrity, and steady support through complex moments.","Thoughtful, firm, and fair \u2014 wisdom spoken with quiet authority.")
B.c9n=new A.he("Wisdom Advisor","MSHAURI AMANI is the elder voice of NGMY Advisors \u2014 an older woman of experience who offers community wisdom, patience, and time-tested guidance for life\u2019s harder questions.","Mature, gracious, and deeply listening \u2014 traditional wisdom delivered with modern respect.")
